      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 55 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_17__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (3c), by inserting after the words “certified copy of the solvency declaration” the words “and notice of such redemption of share in the prescribed form”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_17__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (3c) the following subsection: “(4) If default is made in complying with subsection (3c), the director of the Labuan company who is in default commits an offence under this Act. Penalty: Fifty thousand ringgit or imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or both.”. Amendment of section 58"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_18__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_18__para_b"
      ],
