      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 58 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_18__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1a) If default is made in complying with subsection (1), the Labuan company which is in default commits an offence under this Act. Penalty: Twenty thousand ringgit. Default penalty.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_18__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (6), by substituting for the word “Ten” the word “Twenty”. Amendment of section 69"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
