      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 69 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_19__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by renumbering the existing section as subsection (1); and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_19__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the renumbered subsection (1) the following subsection: “(2) If default is made in complying with this section, the person who is in default commits an offence under this Act. Penalty: Three million ringgit or imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or both.”. Amendment of section 70"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Labuan Companies (Amendment) Act 2022."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 4(b) is deemed to have come into operation on 1 January 2019. General amendments"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Labuan Companies Act 1990 [Act 441], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_20__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_20__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 70 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_20__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by renumbering the existing section as subsection (1); and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_20__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the renumbered subsection (1) the following subsection: “(2) If default is made in complying with this section, the Labuan company, foreign Labuan company or agent of the company who is in default commits an offence under this Act. Penalty: Three million ringgit or imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or both.”. Amendment of section 71"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_21",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "21",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 71 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: “(3) If default is made in complying with this section, the person who is in default commits an offence under this Act. Penalty: One million ringgit or imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or both.”. Amendment of section 72"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_22",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "22",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 72 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: “(3) If default is made in complying with this section, the Labuan company and every officer of the company who is in default commits an offence under this Act. Penalty: Fifty thousand ringgit or imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or both.”. Amendment of section 73"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_23",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "23",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 73 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: “(3) Subsection (1) shall not apply to sections 69, 70, 71 and 72.”. Amendment of section 78"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_24",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "24",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraph 78(2)(c) of the principal Act is amended by inserting before the words “the nominal value” the words “for a foreign Labuan company,”. Amendment of section 80"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_25",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "25",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 80 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1a) A Labuan company shall within thirty days notify the Authority in the prescribed form of any transfer of shares or debentures or any change of the information submitted under subsection (1).”. Amendment of section 83"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_26",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_26__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_26__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 83 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_26__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (2), by substituting for the words “Ten thousand ringgit” the words “Fifty thousand ringgit and default penalty of five hundred ringgit”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_26__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (5), by substituting for the word “Ten” the word “Fifty”. Amendment of section 84"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_27",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "27",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 84(2) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the word “Ten” the word “Fifty”. New section 84a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_28",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "28",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 84 the following section: “Assignment and variation of charge 84a. (1) If after a charge on property of a Labuan company has been created and lodged pursuant to section 84 and if a person other than the original charge holder becomes the new holder of the charge or any variation to the particulars of the charge, the company shall, within thirty days and upon payment of a prescribed fee, lodge with the Authority a notice stating the assignment or variation and the notice shall contain other information as may be determined by the Authority. (2) If default is made in complying with this section, the Labuan company and every officer of the company who is in default commits an offence under this Act. Penalty: Fifty thousand ringgit. Default penalty.”. Amendment of section 85"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_29",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "29",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_29__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_29__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 85 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
