      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1 a) If default is made in complying with subsection (1), the Labuan company and every officer of the company who is in default commits an offence under this Act. Penalty: Fifty thousand ringgit. Default penalty.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_30__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_30",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (4), by substituting for the word “Ten” the word “Fifty”. Amendment of section 87"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "31",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31__para_f"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 87 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1), by substituting for the words “at least one director who may be a resident director” the words “one or more directors at least one of whom shall be a resident director”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2) A resident director of a Labuan company under subsection (1) shall be— (a) a trust officer of a Labuan trust company approved by the Authority under the Labuan Financial Services and Securities Act 2010 made available by the Labuan trust company to be appointed as a resident director; or (b) any natural person who has attained the age of eighteen, who is otherwise of full legal capacity, fulfills such criteria or requirement as may be determined by the Authority and has consented in writing to be appointed as a resident director.”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (5) the following subsection: “(5) A trust officer or a natural person appointed as a resident director pursuant to paragraph (2)(a) or (2)(b), as the case may be, may retire or resign subject to the terms of the agreement between the Labuan trust company and the Labuan company of which he was appointed as resident director.”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting subsection (5a);"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (9) the following penalty provision: “Penalty: Three million ringgit or imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or both.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31__para_f",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "f",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (10) the following subsection: “(10) The fees payable for the appointment as a resident director shall be paid— (a) in the case of the trust officer appointed as a resident director of Labuan company pursuant to paragraph 2(a), to the Labuan trust company which made him available for the appointment; and (b) in the case of the natural person appointed as resident director of Labuan company pursuant to paragraph 2(b), directly to the person.”. Substitution of section 90"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_32",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "32",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 90 the following section: “Persons disqualified from being a director 90. (1) A person shall not be appointed as a director or hold office or take part or be in any way directly or indirectly concerned with or in the management of a Labuan company, if the person— (a) has been convicted of any offence in connection with the formation or management of a corporation or company; (b) has been convicted of any offence involving fraud, bribery or dishonesty; (c) is an undischarged bankrupt or insolvent; or (d) is deemed unfit by the Authority. (2) The Labuan company shall ensure that no person acting or nominated to act as a director or hold office or take part or be in any way directly or indirectly concerned with or in the management of a Labuan company is a disqualified person under subsection (1). (3) If default is made in complying with this section, the person who is in default commits an offence under this Act. Penalty: One million ringgit or imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or both.”. Amendment of section 91"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_33",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "33",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 91 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (10) the following subsection: “(11) If default is made in complying with this section, the director of the company who is in default commits an offence under this Act. Penalty: Three million ringgit or imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or both.”. Amendment of section 92"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/eng@/~cl_34",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "34",
      "hasPart": [
