        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) as renumbered the following subsection: “(2) Any director of a Labuan company who fails to take all reasonable steps to secure compliance by the company with the requirements of this section or a resident director who has by his own wilful act been the cause of any default by the company under this section, commits an offence under this Act. Penalty: Fifty thousand ringgit and default penalty of five hundred ringgit.”. Amendment of section 113"
      }
    },
    {
