        "@value": "Section 130t of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1a) Where a Labuan protected cell company makes any allotment of its cell shares, the protected cell company shall, within thirty days, lodge with the Authority the information of such allotment.”. Amendment of section 131"
