      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 131(1) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “Part VIII and Part X of the Companies Act 1965” the words “Subdivision 3 of Division 7 of Part III and Division 1 and Division 2 of Part IV of the Companies Act 2016”. Substitution of section 132"
      }
